	)
	(text "Configuration: slave serial from the FX3 (M[1:0] = 11); JTAG (Tag-Connect footprint) and test points"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 478.593 25.2 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "14e3bd30-37c2-5e4d-b49e-fd0fc9929869")
	)
	(text "Bank 3 (3.3 V): the 16 comparator outputs, threshold PWM, trigger in / out, LEDs.  Bank 0 (3.3 V): 24 MHz clock, the Pi\nbus lines, the FX3's I2C.  Banks 1 and 2 (1.8 V): GPIF II to the FX3, slave-serial configuration.  VCCAUX = 3.3 V\n(also powers JTAG and SUSPEND).  SUSPEND pulled to ground (not used); CMPCS_B open (UG385).  HSWAPEN\nhigh: no pull-ups during configuration, so the Pi bus pins stay high-impedance."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15 35.4 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "428f746a-839b-57ff-a9f0-13d3461decbe")
	)
	(text "Timebase: 24 MHz oscillator, +/-10 ppm at 25 C, +/-20 ppm over temperature (+/-50 ppm with ageing)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15 150.71 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "46bac963-83a1-5ff4-9dfb-8bdf8cd94e25")
	)
	(text "For a scope or logic analyzer on internal signals.  Inputs without pull-ups until configured (HSWAPEN high)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 226.5 154.31 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "5615e92e-c876-5f50-be84-01fdd9c67e38")
	)
	(text "U: XC6SLX9-2TQG144C (Spartan-6 LX9, 102 user I/O, 32 x 18 kbit block RAM)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15 25.2 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "5d4ef02d-4a25-5148-9f1d-9a322242dbc0")
	)
	(text "Gateware debug pads: four spare bank 0 pins (3.3 V)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 226.5 150.71 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "6510845d-1e9a-5a8d-b4db-871dd6626dfd")
	)
	(text "4  FPGA XC6SLX9-2TQG144C: configuration, clock, banks, supplies"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15 14 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 3 3)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "818c2e5a-4bff-5ff2-a2ce-084d591e5cdf")
	)
	(text "FPGA decoupling: a capacitor at every supply pin, 4.7 uF per rail and per bank"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 368.802 150.71 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "87a9022b-a6b5-5415-be74-11e8f395f62e")
	)
	(text "The host sends the FPGA image at each connection; the FX3 shifts it in on CCLK / DIN.  INIT_B and DONE are read\nback by the FX3.  CCLK has a 33 ohm source resistor at the FX3 (clean edges on the configuration clock).\nJTAG on a Tag-Connect TC2050 footprint in Tag-Connect's Xilinx order (1 VREF = VCCAUX 3.3 V, 2 TMS, 4 TCK, 6 TDO, 8 TDI,\n3 5 7 9 GND, 10 open): a TC2050-IDC cable (the legged one) with the TC2050-XILINX adapter for a Xilinx Platform Cable, or the\nTC2050-XILINX-M for a Digilent JTAG-HS3.  Test points on PROGRAM_B, INIT_B, CCLK, DIN and DONE."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 478.593 37.6 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "aef56fa9-292b-5c85-8f0e-47b22171d060")
	)
	(text "UG393 v1.3 table 2-1, LX9 TQG144: VCCINT 3 x 4.7 uF + 1 x 0.47 uF, VCCAUX 7 + 1, each VCCO bank 1 + 2, no 100 uF.\nVCCAUX and banks 0 and 3 share +3V3: their 14 pin capacitors make up its 9 + 5.  Pin capacitors of 4.7 uF are 0402,\non the 470 nF pads (table 2-2: larger values and smaller bodies allowed)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 368.802 158.71 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "c0c6bd29-a7db-5776-b8ac-c41ba0ce1021")
	)
	(text "PLL: 24 MHz x 25 = 600 MHz VCO -> 200 MHz sample clock, 100 MHz GPIF PCLK.  Pin 1 (enable) tied high."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15 154.31 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "d27e09c5-3a82-5af2-a839-93aed20e7d2a")
	)
